<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexico has deployed 450 troops to Matamoros after a violent weekend that left six dead, including a 7‑year-old American girl, and a US citizen, reflecting heightened cartel activity in the border city. The government also banned cellphones in schools nationwide, despite parents opposing the measure because of safety concerns tied to the violence. These actions show an escalation of security and social control responses to cartel threats. The crisis includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQeUZUVXJob1Vic2tPZlg3YnZqcXJhUG16Qlh0M00wMmFiZGVsMTJ6eHBrM3NnMEhIY25xelZTb0JqUTFBSVJFTlN2VDZsMFF5VEdkUGFuTlE1VmlSd2ZEMFRDcThLZFJMTXVfcWJoYlpLVUpZTGRXR1ZkVmxJRFdrRy05cmRzMnBLMkxyNDdRMTdQUFQ1dzhuNERpYk5wNjhVVzYwWUwtMjcyZnNQbU0zRVR3aW56dGFhTHpTdnBwSWpLNDNKSmdaSGh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE54RmFYMXExS0NodS1pZnNBWko5bEhIS3FPVkJvZkpPS2J2MXd6RjNqaWdOVlF6dVhsZVlDdXU5a3JLWm1WY2RjcldWMjJfNjJtNHdXS195bmJvLVFybnR1ajBwb0lJRGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxNNlYweVQ3cWNrc3lRT0E1WEU4dHNCakUtdWtEVkpFTDhtLUcwYVBHa2h5VEx3QUhCQkYtaExJTF94cDlHWExBRzBpZ1I3M1VwS2JRZUdiRGNQa1hJaThwazBTZDdwUW9TcEgxc3VGbjBLYTBUdnZhTFdubGpfRGFxeU55eWFubVhfaWRQNkpFUE03bFhwQTFpemRrSG4wUWhTUlJrNTV0SkFzSWYxb2gwSW5WelI?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTE9BVWtnQjdoVE40d1VFSVdCMHhiWkZRdDA2a3Z5UjJqdUZ5Y1dDYkpHTTF3a0xLdnZvNlJDa3BRbDFPY3Myel9KMTU3UmNteXNrYzhGbWtsMW4wZkZFQ1N5WFBTRTFkNGhOY1hudDZhcks?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mexico News Daily&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95